## Directives

The build is :badge[green on
every branch]{color=green} today.

Status: :status[on track for
the beta]{color=green}, and :priority[high]
on one line.

Press :kbd[Ctrl+Shift+P] and then
:mention[@dana
lee] reviews it.

## Styled spans

This is [styled across
two lines]{color=red weight=bold} in a paragraph.

- A list item with [a span that
  runs on]{color=blue} inside it
- [ ] A task with :badge[a badge
  that wraps]{color=amber}

> A quote with :badge[a badge
> that wraps]{color=purple} too.

## Next to math

The mass $m$ is :badge[about
$m_0$]{color=teal} at rest.

## Not items

A lone :badge[ with no closing bracket stays text.

A [bracket on one line
and its close on the next] with no attributes is text.
